{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/1e9e6d8241c9eb44b16331702c4b906f.poster.avif?t=1772266336\" width=1170 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/1e9e6d8241c9eb44b16331702c4b906f.webm?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/1e9e6d8241c9eb44b16331702c4b906f.mp4?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Race Max Pro is a fast, stylish arcade racing game that blends Street, Drift, and Drag into one skill-driven experience. Dominate short, high-intensity races with tight controls, deep tuning, and a garage full of real licensed cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/ff258b7909b3ba8fcb8fc29ea9e4173c.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Ways to Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master three distinct racing styles.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street tests your control and racecraft,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift rewards precision and flow,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag demands perfect timing and launch execution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between them instantly each mode sharpens a different skill and keeps every race fast and intense. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/6174400e0402e84cd7deb4761d650c9b.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/75565cd77137b21e7cd2050b8630e1f0.poster.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/75565cd77137b21e7cd2050b8630e1f0.webm?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/75565cd77137b21e7cd2050b8630e1f0.mp4?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single-Player Career</strong>\u2028</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb your way through a full single-player progression.</strong> Beat challenging opponents, earn better rewards, and unlock faster machines as you advance through each chapter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time-Limited Events </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into rotating time-limited events with unique goals and exclusive rewards.\u00a0</strong>Test Drive, Weekly Events, Time Trial, Air Time, Speed Trap each one pushes a different skill and keeps the game fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seasons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete seasonal objectives to unlock limited-edition cars, cosmetics, and performance upgrades.\u00a0</strong>New rewards arrive regularly, expanding your garage over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/e62d9baa56bfe09e0c59be2ae045e730.poster.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/e62d9baa56bfe09e0c59be2ae045e730.webm?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/e62d9baa56bfe09e0c59be2ae045e730.mp4?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/1ae737f2c99523cb034f660cc545e3bd.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/3477df25684e3d034e046b66fff2e6fd.poster.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/3477df25684e3d034e046b66fff2e6fd.webm?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/3477df25684e3d034e046b66fff2e6fd.mp4?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Tuning System</strong>\u2028</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build performance your way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade engine, turbo, gearbox, nitro, tires, and more then fine-tune each setup to match Street, Drift, or Drag. Every part you improve changes how the car feels on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/6725a38ba76546b7eb6e9a32716bda21.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/24ce5eede373adc6688af75752a469f8.poster.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/24ce5eede373adc6688af75752a469f8.webm?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/24ce5eede373adc6688af75752a469f8.mp4?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual Customization</strong>\u2028</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Style your car with full visual freedom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change paint, wraps, rims, spoilers, and more to create a look that matches your racing identity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/51dbf49d81ce0a6c28a0ace3f8b09131.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=253 /></span><strong>Legendary Cars</strong>\u2028</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race with officially licensed icons from BMW, Ford, Nissan, Pagani, Jaguar, Audi, Lotus, Aston Martin, Mazda, Volkswagen, and more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each car is recreated with attention to handling, sound, and performance so every machine feels distinct on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/6177392ea94c212d8788ad6b0fd83876.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer League Mod</strong>\u2028</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete in online leagues built for fast, skill-based races.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb divisions, earn rewards, and face tougher opponents as you rise through the ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge Friends Mode\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race head-to-head with friends or rivals in custom matchups.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick to set up, easy to repeat pure arcade competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/27ac5a7f62bc0cd32f4a4686896c9ae3.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/ba0afb902bd2ea44ae268322bb14a58c.poster.avif?t=1772266336\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/ba0afb902bd2ea44ae268322bb14a58c.webm?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/extras/ba0afb902bd2ea44ae268322bb14a58c.mp4?t=1772266336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to earn Cash, Gold, and Blueprints \u2014 unlock new cars, expand your garage, and push your limits with every upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build. Tune. Race. Repeat.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Street, Drift, Drag race\u00a0 types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ real licensed cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer &amp; Ranked League</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full customization &amp; tuning system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-limited events and Seasons</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3042650?t=1772266336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/3cd31811c5810126e15bf4fe9cd3e1130e54aa12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772266336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042650/69b9bbec6dcd21eb526f33af3a69c97